  "ai_usage": "Comparing two measures across categories. Keep a 2px surface gap between the paired bars, assign hues in the fixed categorical order (never by rank), and never split them onto two y-axes — one scale or two charts.",
  "path": "effects/charts-dataviz/grouped-bar-chart.html",
  "source": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n  <title>Grouped Bars</title>\n  <script type=\"application/json\" id=\"effect-meta\">\n  {\n    \"id\": \"grouped-bar-chart\",\n    \"title\": \"Grouped Bars\",\n    \"summary\": \"Two series compared side by side with a legend.\",\n    \"description\": \"Two series compared side by side with a legend.\",\n    \"theme\": \"charts-dataviz\",\n    \"categories\": [\"chart\", \"dataviz\"],\n    \"tags\": [\"chart\", \"data\", \"grouped\", \"comparison\", \"two-series\", \"legend\"],\n    \"tech\": [\"css\"],\n    \"era\": \"2020s\",\n    \"difficulty\": \"intermediate\",\n    \"dependencies\": [],\n    \"browser_support\": \"All modern browsers (Chromium, Firefox, Safari).\",\n    \"performance_notes\": \"Lightweight — composited transform/opacity work only.\",\n    \"accessibility_notes\": \"Identity is never colour-alone: every multi-series chart ships a legend, direct labels where they fit, and an equivalent table or accessible summary. Grid lines and axes stay recessive; values wear text colours, not series colours.\",\n    \"customization\": [\n      { \"name\": \"--c1\", \"description\": \"Series one\", \"default\": \"#7c5cff\" },\n      { \"name\": \"--c2\", \"description\": \"Series two\", \"default\": \"#10a894\" }\n    ],\n    \"variations\": [\"Swap in your own brand ramp and re-run the palette validator\", \"Add a table view of the same data\"],\n    \"ai_usage\": \"Comparing two measures across categories. Keep a 2px surface gap between the paired bars, assign hues in the fixed categorical order (never by rank), and never split them onto two y-axes — one scale or two charts.\"\n  }\n  </script>\n  <style>\n    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }\n    html, body { height: 100%; margin: 0; }\n    body { display: grid; place-items: center; background: #0b0d12; color: #e7ebf3;\n      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, sans-serif; overflow: hidden; }\n    .fx { --c1: #7c5cff; --c2: #10a894; --c3: #c2891a; --c4: #d1478c; --c5: #2f7cc9;\n      --ink: #e7ebf3; --ink-2: #8b93a7; --grid: rgba(139,147,167,.22); --surface: #0b0d12; width: 310px; }\n    .fx h4 { margin: 0 0 .8rem; font-size: .95rem; color: var(--ink); }\n    .fx .legend { display: flex; gap: 1rem; margin-bottom: .8rem; font-size: .76rem; color: var(--ink-2); }\n    .fx .legend span { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: .35rem; }\n    .fx .legend i { width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 3px; }\n    .fx .plot { display: flex; align-items: flex-end; gap: 12px; height: 130px;\n      background: repeating-linear-gradient(0deg, var(--grid) 0 1px, transparent 1px 32.5px); }\n    .fx .grp { flex: 1; display: flex; align-items: flex-end; gap: 2px; height: 100%; }\n    .fx .grp i { flex: 1; border-radius: 4px 4px 0 0; height: calc(var(--v) * 1%); }\n    .fx .axis { display: flex; gap: 12px; margin-top: .4rem; }\n    .fx .axis span { flex: 1; text-align: center; font-size: .7rem; color: var(--ink-2); }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <figure class=\"fx\" style=\"margin:0\"><h4>Added vs revised</h4>\n  <div class=\"legend\"><span><i style=\"background:var(--c1)\"></i>Added</span><span><i style=\"background:var(--c2)\"></i>Revised</span></div>\n  <div class=\"plot\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Grouped bars comparing added and revised counts across four weeks\">\n    <div class=\"grp\"><i style=\"--v:46;background:var(--c1)\"></i><i style=\"--v:28;background:var(--c2)\"></i></div>\n    <div class=\"grp\"><i style=\"--v:75;background:var(--c1)\"></i><i style=\"--v:40;background:var(--c2)\"></i></div>\n    <div class=\"grp\"><i style=\"--v:60;background:var(--c1)\"></i><i style=\"--v:52;background:var(--c2)\"></i></div>\n    <div class=\"grp\"><i style=\"--v:100;background:var(--c1)\"></i><i style=\"--v:34;background:var(--c2)\"></i></div></div>\n  <div class=\"axis\"><span>W1</span><span>W2</span><span>W3</span><span>W4</span></div></figure>\n</body>\n</html>\n"
}
